# Run with the FULL (unreduced) coarse grid WFN (nosym NSCF). bsemat size ~ (nk*nv*nc)^2 * 16 B: 48 k x 8 x 8 -> 0.15 GB; 144 k x 8 x 8 -> 1.4 GB.
